graph TB
    subgraph Client["🖥️ Frontend (React)"]
        UI["UI Components<br/>React 19 + TypeScript"]
        Router["Routing<br/>Wouter"]
        Query["Data Fetching<br/>TanStack Query"]
        Charts["Visualization<br/>Recharts"]
    end

    subgraph API["🔌 API Layer"]
        tRPC["tRPC 11<br/>Type-Safe RPC"]
    end

    subgraph Server["⚙️ Backend (Express)"]
        subgraph Hex["Hexagonal Architecture"]
            Ports["Ports<br/>Interface Definitions"]
            Domain["Domain<br/>Business Logic"]
            Services["Services<br/>Use Cases"]
            Adapters["Adapters<br/>External Integrations"]
        end
        Router_Server["Routers<br/>Endpoint Handlers"]
    end

    subgraph External["🤖 External Services"]
        LLM["LLM Provider<br/>Medical Analysis"]
    end

    subgraph Data["💾 Data Layer"]
        ORM["Drizzle ORM<br/>Type-Safe Queries"]
        DB["MySQL/TiDB<br/>Relational Database"]
    end

    subgraph Shared["📦 Shared"]
        Types["TypeScript Types<br/>Domain Models"]
    end

    UI -->|tRPC Calls| tRPC
    Router -->|Navigation| UI
    Query -->|Data Management| tRPC
    Charts -->|Visualization| Query
    
    tRPC -->|Type-Safe API| Router_Server
    Router_Server -->|Dependency Injection| Services
    Services -->|Business Rules| Domain
    Domain -->|Port Contracts| Ports
    Ports -->|Implementation| Adapters
    Adapters -->|External Calls| LLM
    
    Router_Server -->|Database Queries| ORM
    ORM -->|SQL Execution| DB
    
    Client -.->|Shared Types| Types
    Server -.->|Shared Types| Types
    
